            <description><![CDATA[<style>
    body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #1d1d1f;
    }
    h2 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
